          "short": "Length $2.2$ units; gradient $2$; midpoint $(1.5,2)$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}d&=\\sqrt{(2-1)^2+(3-1)^2}\\\\d&=\\sqrt5\\approx2.2\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}m&=\\frac{3-1}{2-1}\\\\m&=2\\end{aligned}$$\n$$\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left(\\frac{1+2}{2},\\frac{1+3}{2}\\right)\\\\M&=(1.5,2)\\end{aligned}$$\nLength is in units.",
